  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A Fleur de Chiens, at 54 avenue Janvier Passero in Mandelieu-la-Napoule, is a grooming salon for dogs and cats. Its presentation text, reproduced by the chatsdumonde directory, says: "The A Fleur de Chiens team is happy to offer a makeover to your companion" (translated from French), with quality equipment and cosmetics, and specifies that each service is adapted to the animal's build. The same text says the salon has a space selling cat accessories. The business register (Societe.com and PagesJaunes directories) gives a registration on 31 March 2003 under SIREN number 447 934 902, for a dog grooming activity.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Animals: dogs and cats.</li>
        <li>Phone: 04 92 97 89 32.</li>
        <li>Hours on Google Maps (data of 05/11/2026): Tuesday to Friday, 9am to 5pm; closed Monday, Saturday and Sunday.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>According to Google reviews, the team is described as gentle and patient, including for a matted angora cat that was fully clipped and for a spitz groomed to the owner's precise instructions; satisfaction varies from one review to another (4.3 out of 5 from 83 reviews on Google Maps, 3 out of 5 from 6 reviews on PagesJaunes). The Wheree directory notes that prices may vary from one appointment to another depending on the condition of the coat and the care requested: state the breed, coat length and coat condition when booking.</p>
      <p><strong>Check before you go:</strong> the hours come from directories rather than the salon, and don't quite agree (closing at 5pm or 5:30pm; one directory adds Saturday); no price or service detail is published by the salon. Call 04 92 97 89 32 to book an appointment.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before coming to set an appointment and confirm the closing time.</div>
    </div>

